#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:5
#: 7b2519306c3e42d1aa748746fb923530
msgid "SkyRocket with other Ground Stations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:7
#: a9e71c7fa585463fa6e3ac2787f08068
msgid "The SkyViper has its own app that runs on android or iOS, but to access the full capabilities of the ArduPilot firmware you may prefer to use another ground station package. The SkyViper can work with any of the :ref:`ArduPilot compatible ground stations <common-choosing-a-ground-station>` including :ref:`Mission Planner <planner:install-mission-planner>`.  For any of them:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:9
#: 92d300f238aa4d77bdb18e384e29be49
msgid "connect your PC/tablet/phone to the drone's wifi access point"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:10
#: 53c4f42163094641a29ceff90b991495
msgid "on the ground station set the connection type to \"UDP\" and press connect.  If asked, set the port to \"14550\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:15
#: 3fbf0fade7824e42a2c40185097a08e6
msgid "If using Mission Planner, the video from the SkyViper can be made to appear in the “HUD” (the Heads Up Display which normally shows the blue and green attitude display) The SkyViper uses UDP broadcasts you can connect from multiple devices at once. Use the following setup sequence:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:17
#: 902c7e60c6644b6eae1d0cbe32d6c19b
msgid "Install the gstreamer 1.0-x86_64-1.9.2.msi package from [here](https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/data/pkg/windows/1.9.2/)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:18
#: 2a4fa87c423d4d4ab2111284809169af
msgid "In Mission Planner, right mouse click on the HUD and select \"Video\" then \"Set GStreamer Source\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:19
#: 6b5b25aecba146489873e71141f1bb1a
msgid "Change the IP setting and port for the SkyViper video in Sonix board."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:21
#: ab5b245177a144b7bb4af986529894bf
msgid "**Default Setting in MP** rtspsrc location=rtsp://192.168.1.133:8554/video1 ! application/x-rtp ! rtpjpegdepay ! videoconvert ! video/x-raw,format=BGRA ! appsink name=outsink"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:24
#: 010b609f3d35448881f2ec337278bf48
msgid "**Setting for SkyViper Video MP** rtspsrc location=rtsp://192.168.99.1:5600/video1 ! application/x-rtp ! rtpjpegdepay ! videoconvert ! video/x-raw,format=BGRA ! appsink name=outsink"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:27
#: 1e6a0230b1714f6c9dd7f352b22b93b9
msgid "Launch Mission Planner after the SkyViper has been powered up and the laptop WiFi has been connected to the drone’s wifi access point."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/skyrocket-gcs.rst:31
#: 19c7d4c37a574d9b864c5ee970001480
msgid "The SkyViper uses MAVLink2 by default, which does not work with some older GCS software (such as Tower) that only use MAVLink1. To use these older GCSs you may need to change the :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` parameter to 1 from the default of 2."
msgstr ""
